    "classification": "The CPC 3.0 38999 heading explicitly lists candles and tapers. A qualified complete unscented free-standing wax pillar with an embedded wick fits this entry. A bulk paraffin feedstock, a wick alone, a protected shipping article, a scented alternative or a purely decorative object does not satisfy the narrower PCR boundary.",
    "primary_evidence": "Still Water Candles identifies commercial hand-poured unscented paraffin pillars with natural cotton wicks, colour and distinct model sizes and counts. Its other offerings include decorative finishes. The selected use and actual wick count require product-specific evidence. A production equipment catalogue describes a possible industrial route and cannot supply measured batch, production, airflow or energy data for this maker.",
    "readiness": "The mapping decision retains the authored candidate lifecycle. Actual site measurements, supplier qualification, formal scientific and translation reviews and a publication decision remain separate.",
    "native_identity": "The retained archived Candle record is a physical product flow for a wick in a combustible solid with reference Mass, not an assumption about recipe or reference lifetime. Its Chinese catalogue name covers a broader family. The bound route qualifiers select only the complete paraffin pillar and exclude polishing preparations and decorative-only imitation articles. The independently verified original product, elementary exchange and unit records establish qualified identities only. Fossil and biogenic carbon dioxide or carbon monoxide air emissions require actual onsite factory-test measurements; they cannot be assigned from an assumed consumer use.",
    "measurement": "Reviewed count-to-conditioned net mass, unique first-release events, wax/cotton carbon and factory-test versus consumer use boundaries. Confirmed comparable EN/ZH package ledgers for purchases, first non-purchase receipts including loans/free transfers and real returns tied to this site. Each language has 55 exchange cards. Metered energy, compressed-air volume, provider boundaries and actual polymer package form and coverage are conditional. The target check performed 278 measurements with no skips and retained 49 range warnings."
  },
